---
import SectionHeading from "./ui/SectionHeading.astro";
---

<section id="experience" class="experience">
  <SectionHeading title="Experience" />

  <div class="timeline">
    <article class="timeline-item">
      <div class="timeline-date">Present</div>

      <div class="timeline-content">
        <h3>IT Support Technician</h3>

        <p class="company">Managed Service Provider (MSP)</p>

        <p class="description">
          I provide day-to-day technical support for business clients across a
          variety of industries, helping maintain secure, reliable, and
          productive IT environments. My role combines troubleshooting,
          administration, customer service, and continuous learning while
          supporting Microsoft 365, Windows, networking, and endpoint security.
        </p>

        <ul class="responsibilities">
          <li>
            Administer Microsoft 365, Exchange Online, and Entra ID
            environments.
          </li>

          <li>
            Manage user onboarding, offboarding, licensing, MFA, and password
            resets.
          </li>

          <li>
            Troubleshoot Windows desktops, printers, hardware, networking, and
            application issues.
          </li>

          <li>
            Support Active Directory administration and user account management.
          </li>

          <li>
            Deploy, monitor, and troubleshoot endpoint security solutions.
          </li>

          <li>
            Create PowerShell scripts to automate repetitive administrative
            tasks.
          </li>

          <li>
            Provide remote support using NinjaOne and other remote management
            tools.
          </li>

          <li>
            Document procedures and assist with improving internal support
            workflows.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <div class="tech-stack">
          <span>Microsoft 365</span>
          <span>Exchange Online</span>
          <span>Entra ID</span>
          <span>Active Directory</span>
          <span>PowerShell</span>
          <span>NinjaOne</span>
          <span>SentinelOne</span>
          <span>Guardz</span>
          <span>Barracuda</span>
          <span>Huntress</span>
          <span>SonicWall</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="timeline-item">
      <div class="timeline-date">Ongoing</div>

      <div class="timeline-content">
        <h3>Home Lab & Continuous Learning</h3>

        <p class="company">Personal Infrastructure Project</p>

        <p class="description">
          My home lab serves as a practical learning environment where I build,
          break, troubleshoot, and document enterprise-inspired infrastructure.
          It allows me to gain hands-on experience with technologies beyond my
          daily responsibilities and continually strengthen my systems
          administration skills.
        </p>

        <ul class="responsibilities">
          <li>Deploy and maintain a Proxmox virtualization environment.</li>

          <li>
            Host Docker containers for self-hosted infrastructure and services.
          </li>

          <li>
            Configure Linux servers, storage, permissions, and networking.
          </li>

          <li>
            Experiment with VLANs, routing, DNS, and virtualization concepts.
          </li>

          <li>
            Implement monitoring, dashboards, reverse proxies, and media
            services.
          </li>

          <li>
            Document deployments and maintain a GitHub repository for projects.
          </li>

          <li>
            Practice troubleshooting by intentionally testing and recovering
            from failures.
          </li>

          <li>
            Continuously expand knowledge through hands-on experimentation.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <div class="tech-stack">
          <span>Proxmox VE</span>
          <span>Docker</span>
          <span>Ubuntu Server</span>
          <span>Linux</span>
          <span>Networking</span>
          <span>VLANs</span>
          <span>Nginx Proxy Manager</span>
          <span>PowerShell</span>
          <span>Git</span>
          <span>GitHub</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .experience {
    padding: 8rem 0;
  }

  .timeline {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 3rem;
  }

  .timeline-item {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 140px 1fr;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .timeline-date {
    color: #60a5fa;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    padding-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .timeline-content {
    background: #112240;
    border: 1px solid #233554;
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 2rem;
    transition: all 0.25s ease;
  }

  .timeline-content:hover {
    border-color: #3b82f6;
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.12);
  }

  .timeline-content h3 {
    color: #f8fafc;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .company {
    color: #60a5fa;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0.5rem 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .description {
    color: #94a3b8;
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .responsibilities {
    color: #cbd5e1;
    line-height: 1.9;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .responsibilities li {
    margin-bottom: 0.65rem;
  }

  .tech-stack {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .tech-stack span {
    padding: 0.45rem 0.9rem;
    background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.12);
    color: #60a5fa;
    border: 1px solid rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.2);
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .experience {
      padding: 5rem 0;
    }

.timeline-date {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  width: fit-content;
  padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem;
  border-radius: 999px;
  background: rgba(59,130,246,.12);
  border: 1px solid rgba(59,130,246,.25);
  color: #60a5fa;
  font-size: .75rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: .08em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}
    .timeline-date {
      padding-top: 0;
    }

</style>
